{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wisps of the Elements</i> is a turn-based, grid-based, roguelite. Foes all have unique abilities - and a clever AI to use them in synergy. On each expedition, you only get one spell per element; build smart combinations, or you'll be easy to counter. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is this the game for you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re after a genuine tactical challenge, this is it. But if you prefer an easy grind where your characters grow strong enough to steamroll the enemy \u2014 this won\u2019t be your game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2767430?t=1755436690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755436690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/ec856111a8828fe1310b406f5918dd84716f1375/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755436690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/ec856111a8828fe1310b406f5918dd84716f1375/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755436690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wisps of the Elements</i> is a turn-based, grid-based, roguelite. Foes all have unique abilities - and a clever AI to use them in synergy. On each expedition, you only get one spell per element; build smart combinations, or you'll be easy to counter. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is this the game for you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re after a genuine tactical challenge, this is it. But if you prefer an easy grind where your characters grow strong enough to steamroll the enemy \u2014 this won\u2019t be your game.</p>","developers":["Beno\u00eet Ko"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/ae770b41a25a2d1c5fee516b7755600eb21f1d8f/header.jpg?t=1755436690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257031124,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257031124/movie480.mp4?t=1720472763","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257031124/movie_max.mp4?t=1720472763"},"name":"Playtest trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257031124/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720472763","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steams